            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"chapter-1-of-5-a-letter-across-a-country\">Chapter 1 of 5 \u2014 A Letter Across a Country</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">It begins with an experiment. In the 1960s, letters were mailed to strangers in Nebraska with one rule \u2014 pass it only to someone you know on a first-name basis \u2014 and one target: a stockbroker in Boston. How many hands does a letter like that need? My guess is below, next to what actually happened.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
